<title>USA: Rockwell completes Brooktree acquisition.</title>
<headline>Rockwell completes Brooktree acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SEAL BEACH, Calif. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rockwell International Corp said Wednesday it has completed its acquisition of Brooktree Corp at a price of $15 cash per share.</p>
<p>Brooktree will be operated as a division of Rockwell Semiconductor Systems. The total value of the deal is about $275 million.</p>
<p>Shares of Rockwell closed 1/4 higher at 56-1/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
